    Annotation(rdfs:comment "github.com/LukasSelin/godesign's Go code, described as an OWL 2 ontology by godesign gocode."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :ExternalPackage "A package from outside the github.com/LukasSelin/godesign module that one of its packages imports: part of the standard library, or of a dependency."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :Package "A Go package of the github.com/LukasSelin/godesign module."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :definedIn "The package whose source declares the subject Go type."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :gocode.Conformance "Conformance is how a module measures up against a plan: what was checked, what could not be, and where the two differ."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :gocode.Delta "Delta is what a change did to a module's types, as [Compare] sees it."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :icv.Report "Report is what checking facts against constraints found: what was checked, what broke, what could not be checked, and which terms had nothing in them."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :icv.Violation "Violation is a constraint the facts break, the individual that breaks it, and the edges to blame."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :imports "The subject package imports the object package directly. The object is a :Package or an :ExternalPackage."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment :method "A method the subject Go interface declares, as Name(parameter types) result types."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment godesign:cmd.godesign "Command godesign describes a Go module's code as an OWL 2 ontology and holds changes to that code to a design: plans written before the code, and invariants kept on every change."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment godesign:examples.self "Command self describes godesign's own Go code as an OWL 2 ontology, so that the repository's linter has a real, non-toy ontology of this repository to run on."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment godesign:internal.designgate "Package designgate is a Claude Code PreToolUse hook that keeps a plan ahead of the code, run as \"godesign hook design-gate\"."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment godesign:internal.gocode "Package gocode describes a Go module's code as an OWL 2 ontology."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment godesign:internal.icv "Package icv checks facts against constraints written as OWL 2 axioms, under the closed-world assumption: integrity constraint validation."^^xsd:string)
    AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment godesign:internal.ontologycheck "Package ontologycheck runs gowl's linter and EL reasoner over an ontology edit and reports what the edit changed: new lint findings, classes that became unsatisfiable, and subsumptions the reasoner now derives that nobody asserted."^^xsd:string)
